  "attestation": "D-133 closed-loop round 1 fixes on needs-wording (audit of 6bd1efd: 2 HIGH, 4 MEDIUM, 3 LOW). HIGH-1: an instructor never adopts or confirms words they cannot see: wordEntry returns shown, the full rendered text of every suggestion, edit, confirmed text, values, accepted passages and off-plan passage the question had to shorten; digestQuestion puts it first in the detail, and when it cannot all be shown offers no one-click choice; a correction shows before and after in full (else no Keep/Undo choice; apply records any answer but Undo as kept, unchanged). HIGH-2, MEDIUM-1 and cosmetics: maths and chemistry are read from KaTeX MathML with mhchem (the instance orz-markdown renders with): NO3- NO3 sub minus, Na+(aq), pu units with superscript exponents, isotopes, ominus, spaced relations; tested on 22 ions. MEDIUM-2: forInstructor has two modes; in every text only exact codes go (path and the line after it, unit ids ending in an ordinal, plan-node ids, code-only parentheses, commands); harness notes also lose bare codes and line numbers and say plan for spine; M5 questions, the agent critique and agent recommendations use the agent mode. MEDIUM-3: a knowledge concern without a suggestion is worded neutrally. MEDIUM-4: suggestions offer Change it differently (words required; not an apply). LOW-1: a recommendation is pre-chosen only when it is the choice or the choice then a non-word character. LOW-2: assistant codes capped at 20 per list, 160 characters each, entry at 6000 characters. LOW-3: reviewer and agent words render only maths, orz inline markup and strong emphasis (lightText). The audit probes are adopted as tests/needs-wording.audit.test.mjs (MEDIUM-4 answers with the new choice and checks the recorded choice and words) and registered as evidence of req.host.alembic-needs-wording, whose statement records the round. No finding, evidence, basis, key, apply path or answer meaning changed. CHANGELOG Unreleased updated; VERSION unchanged. Reviewed every required item. Tests: the 36 required plus alembic-needs, alembic-needs-wording, needs-wording.audit and job-release: 585 passed, 0 failed (COURSEWERK_FRAMES=installed, concurrency 2, one test process under the shared lock).",
